# T.K. - Unified Social Visit & Trail Breather Timeline
# Voice: Buff, upbeat modern-life-loving Tikbalang adventurer. Zero time-of-day words. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	TK: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	TK: Uy, boss! Just cooling down under your awning after a steep hill sprint.
	TK: Still blows my mind how smooth paved roads feel under proper sneakers!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	TK: Checking my Nokia map pins under your shade, boss. Best signal spot on the road!
	TK: Holler if any heavy delivery boxes need lifting behind the counter!
else:
	TK: Just passing through, boss! Knees nearly hit my chin tying my laces out front, haha!
	TK: Good seeing your storefront bright and busy!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	TK: Heart rate's back to normal! Time to hit the road again, boss!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	TK: Five bars locked in! Catch you on my next trail pass, boss!
else:
	TK: Alright, legs are itching to move! Stay strong behind that counter, boss!
[end_timeline]
